# Loaded on every rg run via RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH (set in zsh/zsh.d/env.zsh).
# Keeps .git and node_modules out of results even with --no-ignore-vcs
# (nvim's <leader>sG "grep everything"). Explicitly named paths
# (rg foo node_modules/x.js) are still searched.
# Sibling lists: fd/ignore (file finder) and filters.custom in
# nvim/lua/danielyuan/lazy/nvim-tree.lua (file tree).
--glob=!.git/
--glob=!node_modules/
